WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.364
You didn't start your business

2
00:00:04.384 --> 00:00:06.122
to chase paperwork at night.

3
00:00:06.322 --> 00:00:09.331
Quorra Dispatch lets you quote, schedule

4
00:00:09.351 --> 00:00:11.816
send the crew, and get paid.

5
00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:13.490
All from one app.

6
00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:15.383
When someone fills out

7
00:00:15.403 --> 00:00:17.048
the form on your website

8
00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:19.363
it lands right on your leads board.

9
00:00:19.563 --> 00:00:21.451
You'll see who needs a call back

10
00:00:21.471 --> 00:00:23.449
and what each job is worth.

11
00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:26.361
Build a quote from your price book.

12
00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:30.580
Then send it by link, text, or PDF.

13
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.667
Your customer can approve it

14
00:00:32.687 --> 00:00:34.548
and pick a time on their own.

15
00:00:35.348 --> 00:00:37.330
Booked jobs fill your calendar

16
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.126
with every tech assigned.

17
00:00:39.326 --> 00:00:41.531
So the whole crew knows where to be.

18
00:00:42.331 --> 00:00:45.236
On the road, your tech taps On my way

19
00:00:45.256 --> 00:00:46.904
to text the customer.

20
00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:48.864
Then checks in on arrival

21
00:00:48.884 --> 00:00:50.504
and starts the job.

22
00:00:51.304 --> 00:00:52.729
When the work is done

23
00:00:52.749 --> 00:00:54.574
take payment right there.

24
00:00:54.774 --> 00:00:57.130
Let your customer scan a QR code

25
00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.134
or hand them your phone to pay.

26
00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:02.987
By card, Apple Pay, or Google Pay.

27
00:01:03.187 --> 00:01:05.340
And the invoice is marked paid.

28
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.683
You also get recurring service plans

29
00:01:08.703 --> 00:01:11.560
timesheets, and a customer portal.

30
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.784
Where clients can review quotes

31
00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:15.353
and pay invoices.

32
00:01:16.153 --> 00:01:18.624
Plans start at $80 a month.

33
00:01:18.824 --> 00:01:20.968
And monthly plans get half off

34
00:01:20.988 --> 00:01:22.689
for the first three months.

35
00:01:22.889 --> 00:01:25.526
Start your 14-day free trial today.
